WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.898
Module 10 moves from cleaning to reshaping Once data
is trustworthy

00:00:05.924 --> 00:00:10.806
enough for the task we often need to change its
structure for reporting comparison or

00:00:10.819 --> 00:00:17.226
modeling You will work with analytical grain and
wide versus long representations

00:00:18.955 --> 00:00:24.455
The cleaning principles from Module 9 remain
important because reshaping bad or ambiguous data
does

00:00:24.468 --> 00:00:26.244
not fix its quality problems
